---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Terms &amp; Conditions" description="Terms governing use of the LeadsFlo website, its content, and service inquiries." path="/terms-and-conditions/">
  <section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy">
    <p class="section-kicker">LEGAL / WEBSITE USE</p><h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="lf-lede">These terms describe the conditions for using LeadsFlo's website and contacting us about potential services.</p>
    <p class="lf-legal-date">Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-legal-content">
    <h2>1. Using this website</h2>
    <p>By accessing leadsflo.co, you agree to use the website lawfully and not to interfere with its operation, security, or other visitors' access. If you do not agree with these terms, please discontinue use of the website.</p>
    <h2>2. Information on the website</h2>
    <p>Website content is provided for general information and to describe our services. It is not a guarantee of advertising performance, lead volume, revenue, rankings, or business results. Project examples and demonstrations illustrate specific work and may not represent outcomes you will experience.</p>
    <h2>3. Inquiries and service engagements</h2>
    <p>Submitting a contact form does not create a client relationship, obligation to provide services, or binding agreement. Actual services, deliverables, timelines, pricing, ownership, and responsibilities will be governed by a separate written proposal or agreement accepted by both parties.</p>
    <h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Unless otherwise stated, LeadsFlo's original website text, layouts, brand elements, and proprietary materials may not be reproduced commercially without permission. Client logos, trademarks, advertisements, and portfolio examples remain subject to their respective owners' rights. Viewing this website does not transfer intellectual property rights to you.</p>
    <h2>5. Third-party websites and tools</h2>
    <p>Some links, forms, and videos involve external services. We are not responsible for the content, availability, or privacy practices of third-party websites. Their own terms may apply when you use them.</p>
    <h2>6. Availability and changes</h2>
    <p>We may update, suspend, or remove website content at any time. We aim to keep information accurate and the website available but cannot promise uninterrupted access or error-free content.</p>
    <h2>7. Liability</h2>
    <p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, LeadsFlo is not responsible for indirect or consequential losses arising solely from use of the public website or reliance on its general content. Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot legally be excluded.</p>
    <h2>8. Questions and updates</h2>
    <p>We may revise these terms, with the revised date displayed above. For questions about this website or our services, please <a href="/contact/">contact LeadsFlo</a>. For information on inquiry handling, see our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
<style>
.lf-legal-content{max-width:860px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.lf-legal-content h2{font-size:clamp(21px,2.2vw,29px);line-height:1.25;margin:36px 0 12px;color:#17233d}
.lf-legal-content p{line-height:1.85;color:#52617b;margin:0 0 14px}
.lf-legal-content a{color:#315bfa;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.lf-legal-date{font-size:13px;opacity:.75;margin-top:18px}
</style>
</SiteLayout>
